Hence:  
• DRG definition with the highest discharges in 2014 is  
  “470 – Major Joint Replacement or Reattachment of Lower Extremity w/o MCC”.  
• For that DRG, the three cities with the most discharges and their weighted-average total payments are approximately:  
  – New York ≈ $19,306  
  – Philadelphia ≈ $17,842  
  – Los Angeles ≈ $16,503
